IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`

-- P3-art-24: Article 24 of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744): obligations of distributors.
-- Lines 460-467 of the consolidated text. Unchanged by the Omnibus. Article 2(13) names Articles 9 to 15 and 17 to 25, so Article 24 is among those whose application may be limited for an Article 6(1) system (the gate).
-- The party is the distributor (Art 3(7)); the keel decides who is one. Seams: Article 47 (the EU declaration of conformity) and Article 79(1) (a risk) are plain BOOLEAN inputs named for the section they come from, which PLAN.md section 4 does not list for this part; Article 16(b) and (c) and Article 23(3), which paragraph 1 cites, are encoded in P3-art-16 and P3-art-23.
-- "Before making ... available" and "immediately": the distributor's own date of making available is an input; "immediately" is the same day on a clock of whole days (forks F-prior-to and F-immediately in NOTES.md).
-- Reading a result: JUST TRUE met; JUST FALSE the duty applies and is not met; NOTHING not covered (the group does not yet apply, Art 2(13) may limit the Article, or the paragraph's own trigger is absent).
-- For a bar ("shall not ... until"): JUST TRUE the bar is on, JUST FALSE it is off (the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, rules (b) and (d)).

DECLARE `Art 24 act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 24(1) verify, before making the high-risk AI system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1`
    `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market`
    `Art 24(2) inform the provider or the importer of the risk`
    `Art 24(3) ensure that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2`
    `Art 24(4) take the corrective actions or ensure that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator takes them`
    `Art 24(4) immediately inform the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk`
    `Art 24(5) provide the relevant competent authority the information and documentation regarding the distributor's actions`
    `Art 24(6) cooperate with the relevant competent authorities`

§ `Article 24(1): before making the system available, the distributor verifies the CE marking, the declaration of conformity, the instructions for use and the compliance of the provider and the importer`

-- src:462 | 1. Before making a high-risk AI system available on the market, distributors shall verify that it bears the required CE marking, that it is accompanied by a copy of the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 and instructions for use, and that the provider and the importer of that system, as applicable, have complied with their respective obligations as laid down in Article 16, points (b) and (c) and Article 23(3).
@ref Art 24(1) (src:462)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the distributor has verified that the high-risk AI system bears the required CE marking` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has verified that the system is accompanied by a copy of the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 and instructions for use` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has verified that the provider has complied with its obligations as laid down in Article 16, points (b) and (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there is an importer of the system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has verified that the importer has complied with its obligations as laid down in Article 23(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF `the distributor has verified that the high-risk AI system bears the required CE marking` AND `the distributor has verified that the system is accompanied by a copy of the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 and instructions for use` AND `the distributor has verified that the provider has complied with its obligations as laid down in Article 16, points (b) and (c)` AND ((NOT `there is an importer of the system`) OR `the distributor has verified that the importer has complied with its obligations as laid down in Article 23(3)`)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Before making a high-risk AI system available on the market, distributors shall verify that it bears the required CE marking, that it is accompanied by a copy of the EU declaration of conformity referred to in Article 47 and instructions for use, and that the provider and the importer of that system, as applicable, have complied with their respective obligations as laid down in Article 16, points (b) and (c) and Article 23(3)"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(1) (src:462)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the date on which the distributor makes the high-risk AI system available on the market` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(1) the distributor's duty to verify the matters listed in paragraph 1 before making the system available on the market` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(1) verify, before making the high-risk AI system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1`
         WITHIN daysLeft
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the matters listed in paragraph 1 were not verified before the high-risk AI system was made available on the market"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut or Art 2(2) cuts the Article off
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)
        daysLeft MEANS IF (Day `the date on which the distributor makes the high-risk AI system available on the market`) AT LEAST (Day `the date asked`) THEN (Day `the date on which the distributor makes the high-risk AI system available on the market`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`) ELSE 0


§ `Article 24(2): not making the system available while the distributor has reason to consider it non-conforming`

-- "it shall not make the high-risk AI system available on the market until the system has been brought into conformity": a bar, as in Article 23(2): JUST TRUE while the bar is on, JUST FALSE once the "until" is reached (ruling (d)) or where the distributor has no such reason (periods ruling, rule (b); fork F-when-upon).
-- src:463 | 2. Where a distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, it shall not make the high-risk AI system available on the market until the system has been brought into conformity with those requirements. Furthermore, where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall inform the provider or the importer of the system, as applicable, to that effect.
@ref Art 24(2) first sentence (src:463)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that the high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the high-risk AI system has been brought into conformity with those requirements` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(2) the distributor is barred from making the high-risk AI system available on the market` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that the high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2`
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where a distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2" (a "where" that fails: the periods ruling, rule (b))
        ELSE IF `the high-risk AI system has been brought into conformity with those requirements`
             THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it shall not make the high-risk AI system available on the market until the system has been brought into conformity with those requirements" (the "until" has been reached: ruling (d))
             ELSE JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

-- src:463 | 2. Where a distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, it shall not make the high-risk AI system available on the market until the system has been brought into conformity with those requirements. Furthermore, where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall inform the provider or the importer of the system, as applicable, to that effect.
@ref Art 24(2) first sentence (src:463)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that the high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date on which the high-risk AI system is brought into conformity` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(2) the distributor's duty not to make the system available on the market until it has been brought into conformity` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that the high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2`
    THEN CONSIDER `the date on which the high-risk AI system is brought into conformity`
         WHEN JUST conformityDate THEN
             IF (Day conformityDate) GREATER THAN (Day `the date asked`)
             THEN PARTY Distributor
                  SHANT `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market`
                  WITHIN ((Day conformityDate) MINUS (Day `the date asked`)) MINUS 1
                  HENCE FULFILLED
                  LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the high-risk AI system was made available on the market before it had been brought into conformity"
             ELSE FULFILLED  -- the system is already in conformity on the date asked
         WHEN NOTHING THEN
             PARTY Distributor
             SHANT `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market`
             HENCE FULFILLED
             LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the high-risk AI system was made available on the market before it had been brought into conformity"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the distributor has no such reason
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

-- "Furthermore, where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall inform the provider or the importer of the system, as applicable, to that effect."
-- "as applicable": where there is an importer it is the importer who is informed, otherwise the provider (fork F-24-as-applicable in NOTES.md; the other reading is that both are informed).
-- src:463 | 2. Where a distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, it shall not make the high-risk AI system available on the market until the system has been brought into conformity with those requirements. Furthermore, where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall inform the provider or the importer of the system, as applicable, to that effect.
@ref Art 24(2) second sentence (src:463)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there is an importer of the system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has informed the provider of the system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has informed the importer of the system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Furthermore, where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall inform" (no such risk)
        ELSE
             IF (`there is an importer of the system` AND `the distributor has informed the importer of the system`) OR ((NOT `there is an importer of the system`) AND `the distributor has informed the provider of the system`)
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the distributor shall inform the provider or the importer of the system, as applicable, to that effect"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(2) second sentence (src:463)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(2) the distributor's duty to inform the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)`
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(2) inform the provider or the importer of the risk`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the provider or the importer was not informed of the risk"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the system presents no risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)


§ `Article 24(3): storage and transport conditions while the system is under the distributor's responsibility`

-- src:464 | 3. Distributors shall ensure that, while a high-risk AI system is under their responsibility, storage or transport conditions, where applicable, do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2.
@ref Art 24(3) (src:464)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system is under the distributor's responsibility` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there are storage or transport conditions` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(3) the distributor has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the high-risk AI system is under the distributor's responsibility`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "while a high-risk AI system is under their responsibility" (the system is not under the distributor's responsibility)
        ELSE
             IF NOT `there are storage or transport conditions`
             THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "storage or transport conditions, where applicable" (there are none)
             ELSE
                  IF `the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2`
                  THEN JUST TRUE
                  ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Distributors shall ensure that, while a high-risk AI system is under their responsibility, storage or transport conditions, where applicable, do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(3) (src:464)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system is under the distributor's responsibility` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there are storage or transport conditions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(3) the distributor's duty to ensure that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise compliance with Section 2` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the high-risk AI system is under the distributor's responsibility` AND `there are storage or transport conditions`
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(3) ensure that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the storage or transport conditions jeopardised the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, the system is not under the distributor's responsibility, or there are no storage or transport conditions
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)


§ `Article 24(4): corrective actions for a system the distributor has made available, and immediate information where it presents a risk`

-- "shall take the corrective actions necessary ... or shall ensure that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator, as appropriate, takes those corrective actions": either limb meets the duty.
-- src:465 | 4. A distributor that considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market not to be in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, shall take the corrective actions necessary to bring that system into conformity with those requirements, to withdraw it or recall it, or shall ensure that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator, as appropriate, takes those corrective actions. Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall immediately inform the provider or importer of the system and the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned, giving details, in particular, of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken.
@ref Art 24(4) first sentence (src:465)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has taken the corrective actions necessary to bring the system into conformity, to withdraw it or recall it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has ensured that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator, as appropriate, takes those corrective actions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A distributor that considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market not to be in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, shall take" (the distributor has no such reason)
        ELSE
             IF `the distributor has taken the corrective actions necessary to bring the system into conformity, to withdraw it or recall it` OR `the distributor has ensured that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator, as appropriate, takes those corrective actions`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall take the corrective actions necessary to bring that system into conformity with those requirements, to withdraw it or recall it, or shall ensure that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator, as appropriate, takes those corrective actions"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(4) first sentence (src:465)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(4) the distributor's duty to take the corrective actions or ensure that they are taken` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2`
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(4) take the corrective actions or ensure that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator takes them`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "neither the corrective actions were taken nor was it ensured that they are taken"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the distributor has no reason to consider the system not in conformity
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)


-- "the distributor shall immediately inform the provider or importer of the system and the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned, giving details, in particular, of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken."
-- Here "the provider or importer" carries no "as applicable": informing either meets the limb (fork F-24-as-applicable); the authorities and the details are always owed.
-- src:465 | 4. A distributor that considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, a high-risk AI system which it has made available on the market not to be in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, shall take the corrective actions necessary to bring that system into conformity with those requirements, to withdraw it or recall it, or shall ensure that the provider, the importer or any relevant operator, as appropriate, takes those corrective actions. Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall immediately inform the provider or importer of the system and the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned, giving details, in particular, of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken.
@ref Art 24(4) second sentence (src:465)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has informed the provider or importer of the system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has informed the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information gives details of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall immediately inform" (no such risk)
        ELSE
             IF `the distributor has informed the provider or importer of the system` AND `the distributor has informed the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned` AND `the information gives details of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the distributor shall immediately inform the provider or importer of the system and the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned, giving details, in particular, of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(4) second sentence (src:465)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(4) the distributor's duty to inform the provider or importer and the competent authorities immediately of the risk` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)`
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(4) immediately inform the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk`
         WITHIN 0
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the provider or importer and the competent authorities were not informed immediately of the risk"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the system presents no risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)


§ `Article 24(5): information and documentation upon a reasoned request`

-- src:466 | 5. Upon a reasoned request from a relevant competent authority, distributors of a high-risk AI system shall provide that authority with all the information and documentation regarding their actions pursuant to paragraphs 1 to 4 necessary to demonstrate the conformity of that system with the requirements set out in Section 2.
@ref Art 24(5) (src:466)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `a relevant competent authority has made a reasoned request to the distributor` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has provided all the information and documentation regarding its actions pursuant to paragraphs 1 to 4 necessary to demonstrate the conformity of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(5) the distributor has provided the relevant competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `a relevant competent authority has made a reasoned request to the distributor`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Upon a reasoned request from a relevant competent authority, distributors of a high-risk AI system shall provide that authority with all the information and documentation" (no reasoned request has been made)
        ELSE
             IF `the distributor has provided all the information and documentation regarding its actions pursuant to paragraphs 1 to 4 necessary to demonstrate the conformity of the system with the requirements set out in Section 2`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Upon a reasoned request from a relevant competent authority, distributors of a high-risk AI system shall provide that authority with all the information and documentation regarding their actions pursuant to paragraphs 1 to 4 necessary to demonstrate the conformity of that system with the requirements set out in Section 2"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(5) (src:466)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `a relevant competent authority has made a reasoned request to the distributor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(5) the distributor's duty to provide the relevant competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `a relevant competent authority has made a reasoned request to the distributor`
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(5) provide the relevant competent authority the information and documentation regarding the distributor's actions`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the information and documentation regarding the distributor's actions were not provided"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or no reasoned request has been made
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)


§ `Article 24(6): cooperation with the relevant competent authorities`

-- src:467 | 6. Distributors shall cooperate with the relevant competent authorities in any action those authorities take in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributors, in particular to reduce or mitigate the risk posed by it.
@ref Art 24(6) (src:467)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributor` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities in that action` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 24(6) the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributor`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in any action those authorities take in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributors" (no such action)
        ELSE
             IF `the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities in that action`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Distributors shall cooperate with the relevant competent authorities in any action those authorities take in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributors, in particular to reduce or mitigate the risk posed by it"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

@ref Art 24(6) (src:467)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 24 act`
`Art 24(6) the distributor's duty to cooperate with the relevant competent authorities` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to a high-risk AI system made available on the market by the distributor`
    THEN PARTY Distributor
         MUST `Art 24(6) cooperate with the relevant competent authorities`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Distributor BECAUSE "the distributor did not cooperate with the relevant competent authorities"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the authorities have taken no action
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 24, "", 0)

